{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.toru.first",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "站前，一个女生看着公交站牌",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.toru.first",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.toru.first",
    "idolId": "toru",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（……赶不上了。）",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊——……走了。",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "……走过去更快哦。",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶？……啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "车站对吧。公交还要四十分钟左右才来。",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……！",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（好漂亮的女孩……）",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "谢谢——四十分钟啊……",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "……",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……那个，你没参加什么社团吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "——……为什么？",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这个……你对偶像，有兴趣吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "……诶？",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不好意思突然说这个。我是做偶像制作的——",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "不用了……我走了。",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊，抱歉！抱歉，等一下！",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "……你很烦诶。那种事不用了。",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "——不是，那个……我走就是了！",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "……诶？",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "突然说这些很失礼，我光顾着看你了……车站是这边吧！我走过去，你等公交就好。",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那——",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "……——……等一下。",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "等一下。",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……诶……",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "……不是，这个。",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……？——啊，透明胶带。",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "沾在衣服上了。",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶，哇……！你帮我弄掉了……",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "……刚才，我也抱歉。名片我收下就好。",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "那我走了。"
      }
    }
  },
